	(text "MOTOR BRIDGE L - 2x BTS7960B full H-bridge, left-side motors (2 in parallel). Plan ~20 A stall.\nIS: 470R to GND (7 mA fault -> 3.3 V, ~1.1 V at 20 A with kILIS 8500), 1k + 10nF RC, BAT54S clamp to GND/3V3.\nSR 5.1k sets slew rate (0603: swap 0R = fastest / 51k = slowest)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
